  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="style_lv8"&gt;（税効果会計関係）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;1．繰延税金資産及び繰延税金負債の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 18px"&gt;
